From: OpenDesk <opendesk>
Date: 2026-04-02
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Add hilog diagnostics for SIGABRT crash debugging + AbortGuard

Debugging aid for SIGABRT crash on mouse/touch Move event:
1. Replace all fprintf(stderr,"[MNP-TOUCH]") with OH_LOG_Print(LOG_APP,LOG_INFO,0xF100)
   — fprintf(stderr) is NOT captured by hilog; OH_LOG_Print is visible in hilog -Q output
2. Add #include <hilog/log.h> header
3. 12 diagnostic log points covering full call chain:
   - DoButtonMove: ENTER/EXIT around ButtonMoveWithModifiers()
   - OnTouchDown: ENTER → calling DoButtonDown → returned/recovered → EXIT
   - OnTouchMove: ENTER → calling DoButtonMove → returned/recovered → EXIT
4. AbortGuard (sigaction+siglongjmp RAII) wraps OnTouchDown/Move/Up calls
5. DoTickCaret() + BN_Sci_Tick() for caret blink timer support

Files: ohos/ScintillaOHOS.cxx
Status: DIAGNOSTIC ONLY — to be removed after root cause is fixed

